## Scope of this license (FR15a)

This license covers only the code in this repository — the MCP tool wrapper/integration code that
calls Aspose Cloud APIs on a caller's behalf. It does **not** cover, and does not grant any rights to,
the Aspose Cloud products or APIs themselves, which remain governed entirely by Aspose's own product
and usage terms (see https://purchase.aspose.cloud/policies). Using this code still requires a valid
Aspose Cloud account and subscription/credentials under Aspose's own terms; this MIT license neither
substitutes for those terms nor extends any rights against Aspose. Conversely, having an Aspose Cloud
subscription does not itself grant any license to this repository's own code beyond what this file
states.
